(## 6. Commission on Qualifying Initial Signups) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.1 Subject to this Agreement, the Contractor shall be paid ?25.00 commission for each ) Tj
T*
(qualifying initial subscription signup at the ?49.99 monthly subscription level.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.2 A signup qualifies only where all of the following are met:) Tj
T*
(- the dealership/lease company successfully creates an account;) Tj
T*
(- valid subscription/payment setup is successfully completed;) Tj
T*
(- the account is accepted/approved by TradeStock; and) Tj
T*
(- the signup is genuine, valid, and not fraudulent.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.3 Commission under this Clause 6 is once-off only and is payable only for the initial ) Tj
T*
(qualifying signup.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.4 No commission is payable for duplicate, cancelled, refunded, invalid, fraudulent, or ) Tj
T*
(rejected signups.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 7. Volume Bonus) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7.1 The Contractor is eligible for a ?1,000.00 bonus for each completed block of 100 qualifying) Tj
T*
( subscribers personally onboarded by the Contractor.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7.2 This bonus is paid once only per completed block of 100 and does not accrue on a partial ) Tj
T*
(block.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7.3 TradeStock?s records shall determine qualifying totals acting reasonably and in good faith.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
