T*
( totals.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 8. Retention Bonus) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8.1 Subject to this Agreement, the Contractor is eligible for a ?25.00 retention bonus for each) Tj
T*
( qualifying customer originally onboarded by the Contractor for every completed 90-day period.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8.2 A retention bonus is payable only where, for the relevant completed 90-day period:) Tj
T*
(- the subscriber remains active on the platform;) Tj
T*
(- the subscription is paid and current;) Tj
T*
(- the account was originally onboarded by the Contractor; and) Tj
T*
(- the account is not refunded, fraudulent, invalid, or cancelled.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8.3 Retention bonuses are paid only after completion of each relevant 90-day cycle and ) Tj
T*
(completion of TradeStock?s verification.) Tj
